  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"></span> has released the admit card for the post of <strong><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">National Defence Academy NDA &amp; Naval Academy NA -II</span> 2026</strong> on the official website of UPSC. This recruitment was released for <strong>394 posts</strong>. The online application process for UPSC NDA/ NA-II Recruitment 2026 were accepted from 20 May 2026, to 11 June 2026. The examination is going to conducted on <strong>13 September 2026</strong>. Candidates who had applied this form can download their <strong>UPSC NDA/ NA-II Admit Card 2026</strong> from the link given below.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSC NDA/ NA-II Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt No: 10/2026-NDA-II</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>20 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>11 June 2026 (Extended)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>11 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : <b>13 September 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>03 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Date :<strong>&nbsp;Will Be Update Here Soon</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC <strong>: Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSC NDA/ NA-II Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Candidates must have born between 01 January 2008 to 01 January 2011</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPSC NDA/ NA-II Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"></span>Tool –</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSC NDA &amp; NDA II Recruitment 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 394</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.4752%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Post Name</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.0127%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Wing Name</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.4752%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">National Defence Academy NDA (Male / Female)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.0127%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Army</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\">208</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.0127%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Navy</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\">42</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.0127%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Airforce</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\">120</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.4752%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Naval Academy NA Only for Male</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.0127%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">10+2 Cadet Entry</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\">24</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPSC NDA/ NA-II Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3561%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.6439%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility </strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3561%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">National Defence Academy</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.6439%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have completed their Intermediate or Equivalent Level of Exam from any Recognized Board.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3561%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Naval Academy</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.6439%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have Completed their Intermediate with Physics &amp; Maths from any recognized Board.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSC NDA / NA-II Online Form 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Written (Objective Test)</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Physical Fitness Test.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UPSC NDA/ NA-II Admit Card 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Check the Important Links section.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Then click on the download admit card link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the admit card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">The candidate can also download their admit card download from the official Website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align